WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.734 --> 00:00:19.746
Toad, Mole, and Rat rode in the cart.

2
00:00:19.747 --> 00:00:24.492
They were tired and covered in dust.

3
00:00:24.493 --> 00:00:27.177
The sun was setting.

4
00:00:27.178 --> 00:00:31.608
The sky was pink with the fading light.

5
00:00:31.609 --> 00:00:35.501
"Let's stop for the night," said Rat.

6
00:00:35.502 --> 00:00:38.688
"Yes, let's," said Mole.

7
00:00:38.689 --> 00:00:42.068
"Wonderful idea!" said Toad.

8
00:00:42.069 --> 00:00:44.573
"I'm hungry."

9
00:00:44.574 --> 00:00:48.886
They stopped the cart and untied the horse.

10
00:00:48.887 --> 00:00:53.461
The stars came out in the dark sky.

11
00:00:53.462 --> 00:00:58.225
They ate a simple supper under the moon.

12
00:00:58.226 --> 00:01:01.937
"Time for bed," said Toad.

13
00:01:01.938 --> 00:01:06.531
He snuggled under his blanket on the grass.

14
00:01:06.532 --> 00:01:10.110
"What a great day!" he said.

15
00:01:10.111 --> 00:01:13.627
"So much better than that old river."

16
00:01:13.628 --> 00:01:20.085
Toad closed his eyes and began to snore.

17
00:01:20.086 --> 00:01:23.965
"Oh, my river," sighed Rat.

18
00:01:23.966 --> 00:01:31.990
"I miss it very much."

19
00:01:31.991 --> 00:01:36.289
Mole lay next to Rat.

20
00:01:36.290 --> 00:01:39.515
He squeezed Rat's paw.

21
00:01:39.516 --> 00:01:41.405
"Rat," said Mole, "should we run away tomorrow?

22
00:01:43.912 --> 00:01:46.647
We can go home to the river."

23
00:01:46.648 --> 00:01:48.780
"No," said Rat.

24
00:01:48.781 --> 00:01:51.135
"We have to stay with Toad.

25
00:01:51.136 --> 00:01:54.573
It would not be safe to leave him."

26
00:01:54.574 --> 00:01:58.511
Mole yawned. "Okay."

27
00:01:58.512 --> 00:02:03.081
"Toad's foolish ideas never last long," said Rat.

28
00:02:03.082 --> 00:02:05.117
Rat was right.

29
00:02:05.117 --> 00:02:08.534
Tomorrow everything would change.

30
00:02:08.535 --> 00:02:14.322
"Goodnight, Mole," yawned Rat.

31
00:02:14.323 --> 00:02:25.882
But Mole was already fast asleep.
